    "Scan of the 1957 edition of the South River, Maryland, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Army Corps of Engineers. Surveyed in 1944; aerial photographs from 1977; field checked in 1957; photo revised in 1978; last revised in 1978; printed in 1987.",
